cff-version: 1.2.0
title: paper2code — verified paper reproduction as an agent skill
message: >-
  If you use paper2code in your research or teaching, please cite the repository.
authors:
  - family-names: Xue
    given-names: Yuxuan
    alias: SCUTxyx
    website: "https://github.com/SCUTxyx"
version: v0.3.0
date-released: "2026-09-26"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/SCUTxyx/paper2code"
abstract: >-
  paper2code turns "reproduce the core method of a paper" into a standard, verified
  action: a numpy minimal implementation, green gradient/property tests against the
  paper's own mathematical claims, a method card, a formula-to-code map, and an honest
  gap list. Delivered as an agent skill; verification is CPU-only and dependency-free.
keywords:
  - reproducibility
  - machine learning
  - verification
  - agent skills
